# Every file in this repository is owned by the maintainer.
#
# The security boundary lives in a handful of these files - the exact Path()
# rules in edge/dynamic/bothy-api.yml and edge/dynamic/bothy-prom.yml (the
# latter is generated and gitignored), the socket-proxy settings in
# apps/bothy/compose.socket-proxy.yml, and the auth stack in auth/ and edge/dynamic/auth.yml.
#
# Those Path() rules are one edge control; the role gates are the other. The
# gates (sso-viewer / sso-editor / sso-operator) are defined once in
# edge/dynamic/bothy-gates.yml and attached to every router in the Bothy tier
# files; only the bare sso@file in auth.yml is attached to no router. The Traefik
# dashboard router was deleted (2026-08-12) because /api/rawdata leaked the live
# basic-auth header from bothy-prom.yml. Review a change to any of these files,
# bothy-gates.yml included, as a security change. See SECURITY.md.

